  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a medium pan over medium heat. Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for about 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and green bell pepper. Cook for 4 to 5 minutes, stirring often, until the onion softens.",
    "Stir in the garlic and ginger, then add the turmeric, chilli powder, curry powder, and salt. Cook for 30 seconds to bloom the spices.",
    "Add the tomato and peas and cook for 2 minutes, until the tomato starts to soften.",
    "Pour in the water and bring to a gentle simmer. Stir in the rolled oats and cook for 4 to 5 minutes, stirring frequently, until thick and creamy.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed. Serve hot, topped with fresh coriander."
